				<div class="et_pb_text_inner"><p>The conference is aimed at payers and insurance organisations, policymakers and regulators, industry representatives, patient representatives, researchers and academics, and clinicians interested in the future of healthcare decision-making and sustainable access to innovation in Europe.</p></div>
