				<div class="et_pb_text_inner"><h6>James Ryan</h6></div>
			</div><div class="et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_31_tb_body  et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light">
				
				
				
				
				<div class="et_pb_text_inner"><p>James Ryan is Senior Director, Global HTA Policy at AstraZeneca, leading initiatives in health technology assessment, payer evidence, health economic modelling, and policy development. He is an industry expert in the implementation of the EU HTA Regulation and Joint Clinical Assessments (JCA) and leads AstraZeneca’s internal JCA readiness. James serves as Vice-Chair of the EFPIA HTA Working Group and represents AstraZeneca at the HTAi Global Policy Forum. He has contributed to numerous industry, academic, and policy initiatives focused on HTA and value assessment. He holds an MSc in Health Economics from the University of York and a BA in Economics.</p></div>
			</div>
			</div>
				
				
				
				
			</div><div class="et_pb_row et_pb_row_22_tb_body speaker-more et_pb_equal_columns">
