				<div class="et_pb_text_inner"><h6>Josephine Mosset</h6></div>
			</div><div class="et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_33_tb_body  et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light">
				
				
				
				
				<div class="et_pb_text_inner"><p>Josephine Mosset is Head of Policy at Cancer Patients Europe (CPE), where she leads the organisation’s policy and advocacy work at EU level. She specialises in EU health policy, patient advocacy, health technology assessment and access to innovation, with a focus on ensuring patient perspectives are reflected in health policy and decision-making. Before joining CPE in 2024, Josephine held roles across the nonprofit and private sectors, including at EURORDIS, Friends of Europe, the Africa-Europe Foundation and Amgen. She holds a master’s in public policy, specialising in Global Health, from Sciences Po Paris.</p></div>
			</div>
			</div>
				
				
				
				
			</div><div class="et_pb_row et_pb_row_23_tb_body speaker-more et_pb_equal_columns">
