				<div class="et_pb_text_inner"><h6><strong>Sara Marques</strong></h6></div>
			</div><div class="et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_47_tb_body  et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light">
				
				
				
				
				<div class="et_pb_text_inner"><p>Sara Marques is a life sciences leader with 15 years of experience across the pharmaceutical industry, health policy consulting and academia. A pharmacist with a PhD in oncology, she has worked at the intersection of health policy and commercial strategy across Europe and Canada. Most recently at AstraZeneca, Sara held senior regional roles spanning oncology policy, government affairs, commercial strategy and launch readiness. She led policy and health system initiatives and cross-country strategies for innovative oncology medicines. Sara is particularly interested in bringing diverse stakeholder perspectives together to address health system challenges and support sustainable patient access to innovation across Europe.</p></div>
